  "notes": [
    "DetailStylesAdd maps 0 -> stored 0x00 (Work), 4 -> 0x02 (Actual Work), 1 -> 0x09 (Cost); the 0x2240003c payload is raw ids with no count prefix, 0xff-padded to 111 bytes.",
    "The stored timescale units decode as MPXJ kUnits[stored + 1]: middle 3 = weeks, bottom 2 = days; counts 1/1, formats 13/20, bottom align 1 (centre), middle align 0 (left), start 14400 tenths-minutes (1984-01-01, the unset value), size 100.",
    "COM TimeScaleData returns minutes for Work/Actual Work and currency units for Cost; blank buckets are the empty string and are recorded here as null.  Costs are recorded in integer cents to avoid the measured float noise (2400.0000000000005).",
    "The Task Usage grid's time-phased columns are 64 px for Work + Actual Work, 84 px with Cost; Resource Usage's Work + Cost is 105 px.  The minimum is 64 px and the width follows the widest rendered cost text; the probe pair isolates the detail set."
  ]
